## Option 1: MkDocs Static Output Served on Next.js Route

### Architecture
```
/docs route in Next.js → serves MkDocs static HTML
MkDocs build → output to public/docs/
Next.js middleware → NextAuth protection on /docs/*
```

### Implementation
```yaml
# mkdocs.yml
