## Implementation Patterns

### Pattern 1: React Context for State Management

**Why:** Avoid prop drilling, global sprint state needed across components

**Structure:**
```typescript
<SprintProvider>  {/* Wraps entire sprint section */}
  <SprintOverview />
  <SprintDashboard />
  <DayContent />
</SprintProvider>
