# Sprint Gamification & Incentivization PRD (Phase 1.5)

**Version:** 1.0
**Created:** 2025-10-16
**Status:** Ready for Implementation
**Phase:** 1.5 (Bridge between Phase 1 MVP and Phase 2 Full Gamification)
**Priority:** Critical (Directly impacts completion rates)
**Owner:** Product Team

